---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: "Releases and notes from the Too Many Cooks team: what shipped, what broke, what we fixed."
permalink: /blog/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="blog-index">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="blog-index-header reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">// blog</p>
      <h1>Notes from the kitchen</h1>
      <p class="blog-index-lede">What shipped, what broke, what we fixed.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="post-list post-grid">
      {%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <article class="post-card{% if loop.first %} post-card-featured{% endif %}" style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}">
        {%- set coverPost = post %}
        {% include "partials/post-cover.njk" %}
        <div class="post-card-body">
          {%- if post.data.category %}<span class="chip">{{ post.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}
          <h2 class="post-card-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-title">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          {%- if post.data.description %}<p class="post-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
          {%- set bylinePost = post %}
          {% include "partials/post-byline.njk" %}
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
